{"lang": "zh_CN", "eventid": "act52side", "eventName": "昨日海", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "YW-1", "avgTag": "行动后", "storyName": "互助会", "storyInfo": "德鲁莎怀疑技术工阿奎拉参与了非法行动，纳乔与克莱门莎为其解围。教堂内，阿奎拉的互助会导师露出真身，他正是深海主教奥卢斯。", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g8_shipatelier", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$loneliness_intro", "key": "$loneliness_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大海的气味……", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1"}, {"id": 13, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "打捞船不是审判庭收缴的违禁品，而是真正投入使用的载具。虽然我一直坚信这一天终将到来，但还是……难以置信。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#8$1"}, {"id": 15, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "船厂路滑，还请您务必小心，斐戴拉大审判官。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#1$1"}, {"id": 17, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_fsmummy", "loop": "true", "channel": "bgs"}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "虽然你已经辞去审判官的职务，但作为达里奥的学生，你仍是审判庭最锋利的刺剑之一。在我身边，怎么倒像是搀扶老人的拐杖了？", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 24, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我绝无轻视您的意思！", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1"}, {"id": 26, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只是您自……老师牺牲之后，主动参加了几乎每一场海嗣剿灭行动。也正是因为那些战斗留下的沉疴，圣徒阁下才将您调至船厂。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#10$1"}, {"id": 28, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "被海风侵蚀的伤口总是好得慢一些，不是什么大事。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 30, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "至于达里奥……圣徒阁下让我辨认达里奥遗体的时候，我只看到了一把不知是人还是海嗣的骨头烧成的灰。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 31, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但我知道他是为了伊比利亚的明天而死，他的名字刻在海风一时半刻吃不掉的地方，这就够了。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 32, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "放轻松点吧，艾丽妮。雷亚-伊比利亚是个不同的地方，我们即将在这里见证伊比利亚摆脱它的沉疴。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 33, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "若能如此，远离地牢，远离跟岛民们算不清的旧账，我们就在船厂作伴又有什么不好呢？", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 34, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您说得没错。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#8$1"}, {"id": 36, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只是我原以为圣徒阁下会将您调派至巡逻组。让一名曾抗击暴风与邪祟的大审判官负责管理打捞沉船残骸的船厂，实在有些……", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#8$1"}, {"id": 37, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 38, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "打捞残骸，修补船只，确实不是大审判官的职责。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 39, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但在被我们用来焚烧海嗣之前，提灯首先是照亮海雾的工具。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 40, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果港都要成为连通陆地与海洋的港口，那么伊比利亚人需要重新学会造船、出海。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 41, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您和卡门阁下说的几乎一模一样。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#2$1"}, {"id": 43, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我毕竟是他的学生，这些年来，我从他身上学到的不只有杀死海嗣的技巧。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 45, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "然而有些东西，哪怕我在他身边再久，都无法学到……", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 46, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#12$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 47, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "斐戴拉大审判官？", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#12$1"}, {"id": 48, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "没什么。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 50, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在迷雾中航行太久的船总需要喘口气，正好，这里就是修补它的地方。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 51, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我会遵从圣徒阁下的意愿，在这里好好休养。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 52, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 55, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 57, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g12_underseahall_d", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 59, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$m_dia_street_intro", "key": "$m_dia_street_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 61, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#10$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 63, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 65, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这里就是水下观测厅，用于操作支撑外围城区和中心城区的起重机。", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "技术工的工作，就是连接灯塔与起重机的能源管路，让三十七座灯塔为起重机供能，实现之后的打捞计划。", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 68, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#8$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "克莱门莎监事，您一直盯着窗外，是在担心水下作业的情况吗？", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唔……现在正在工作的是二组的技术工对吗？棕头发的是索莱达，动作最麻利的是马修。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "看来就算没有我介绍，您对打捞组也已经足够了解了。", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只是记住几个名字，算不上了解。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在军团服役时，我用来记住每一个士兵名字的方法，是将航路上的坐标跟人一一对应。数字的组合是独一无二的，每一个人也是如此。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#8$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 79, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这个方法听上去更复杂了……", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "记忆和了解完全不同。我相信只有切实交流之后，冰冷的信息才会变成一种感受，让你了解一个人、一片土地。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "克莱门莎", "content": "不过在找到合适的机会之前，所有的信息和知识只能暂且存放在我的脑子里，比如——"}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 84, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "克莱门莎", "content": "鲁菲纳。"}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 86, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "！", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#6$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 88, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她是你的奶奶对吗？她曾经参与港都的建设，是位优秀的工人，我为你失去她而感到抱歉。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 90, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您真的记得……不用抱歉，自奶奶病重去世已经过了十年，我也习惯独自一人生活了。", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我的假肢就是她做的，是它让我觉得奶奶一直在陪着我，可现在……", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 92, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "action": "shake", "power": 7.0, "times": 5.0, "duration": 0.3}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.7}}, {"id": 95, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#8$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯？什么东西在撞我的腿？", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 98, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1401_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 100, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_microrobot", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "发现故障，发现故障。", "name": "小帮手"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1401_1#1$1"}, {"id": 103, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "肢体模块磨损严重。为了我们更好的明天，请使用者严格遵守八小时工作制。", "name": "小帮手"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1401_1#1$1"}, {"id": 104, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "——监测到患者疼痛等级接近忍耐极限，需立刻移除肢体模块。准备进行手术。", "name": "小帮手"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1401_1#1$1"}, {"id": 105, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 106, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$e_atk_saw_n_2", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "action": "shake", "power": 5.0, "times": 150.0, "duration": 1.0, "isblock": "true"}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 110, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "等、等等——", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1"}, {"id": 112, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 113, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1401_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "别激动，小帮手。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "all"}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$e_atk_saw_n_1", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 123, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "欸……您……徒手卸下了它的旋转刀头吗？", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这台小帮手上装的是战时医疗模块，强制打断它的动作会比语音指令更快一些。抱歉，擅自扫描了你的生命体征和假肢使用情况。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我想，大概是因为前几天我在水下作业时，弄丢了假肢上的一枚螺栓，所以小机器人才报错的。", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你愿意让我检查一下吗？我会比小帮手礼貌一些。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1401_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "小帮手"}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好的。", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "令人惊叹。假肢上用的所有零件都再普通不过，但它别出心裁的架构方式似乎完美适配了你的需求。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 141, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不过锈蚀还是太严重了，连接处的伤口情况也比我想象的更糟，上面还有烧伤的瘢痕。你是一直忍着疼痛在工作？", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 144, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "因为痛是可以忍的。至于烧伤……来自十几年前扔进我房间的一枚燃烧瓶。我活着逃了出来，但手还是没保住。", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#11$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "惨重的意外。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是啊，那是我第一次见到奶奶露出那么伤心的表情。", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 149, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她是个坚韧严格的长辈，哪怕我的同龄人早早就去开垦盐碱地或者捕鳞了，她也依然执着地要求我学习阿戈尔语和工程设计。", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 151, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "难怪，你的阿戈尔语说得非常标准。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 152, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 153, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "要是让她知道我刻意忽视她的提醒，戴着假肢下水，还弄丢了她的零件，不知道她会多生气……", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "掉入茫茫大海中的一颗螺栓，想必也是找不回来了。", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 155, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哪怕是一颗螺栓，掉入海中时也会掀起波澜，未必找不回来。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 157, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不过，当务之急是要处理假肢的问题。你希望继续完成水下作业，亲手打捞港都中心城区？", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 159, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是的，这对我来说很重要。", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 161, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 162, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好，我可以让小帮手打印一只更适配你现在工作需要的假肢。设计需要花费一些时间，但至少它会让你工作时不必为疼痛分心。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 163, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 164, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "谢谢您，克莱门莎监事。", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 165, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 167, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside", "loop": "true", "channel": "bgs", "volume": 0.0}}, {"id": 169, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.4, "channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "发生了什么？", "name": "好奇的技术工"}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "有个穿着惩戒军制服的人正在打捞中心乱晃。", "name": "路过的技术工"}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "查案？", "name": "好奇的技术工"}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "看着不像，她好像在跟阿奎拉确认签到日志的问题。", "name": "路过的技术工"}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "又是刻意刁难？我以为至少在这里不会碰到这种事。", "name": "好奇的技术工"}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不好说啊，不过那个惩戒军好像也是个岛民。", "name": "路过的技术工"}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿奎拉……？", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 184, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 186, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 188, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 189, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g10_underseacorr", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 190, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$ponder_intro", "key": "$ponder_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 192, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "长官，不是例行证件检查吗，还没结束？", "name": "阿奎拉"}}, {"id": 194, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 195, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "德鲁莎", "content": " 哎呀，实在抱歉，阿奎拉小姐是吧？你确认一下这里的进出记录就好……"}}, {"id": 196, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#5$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_pendrop", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 198, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "德鲁莎", "content": " 啊！"}}, {"id": 199, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_clothmovement", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 201, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "0,-70", "duration": 0.5, "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0}}, {"id": 202, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "posfrom": "0,-70", "posto": "0,0", "duration": 0.8, "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 204, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.2}}, {"id": 205, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "笔拿稳了。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#4$1"}, {"id": 207, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 208, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "多谢你，好心的同胞。", "name": "德鲁莎"}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我从未听说惩戒军的队伍里有岛民。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#4$1"}, {"id": 211, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 212, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "严格来说我不能算审判庭的人，不过是个连队伍番号都没有的小角色罢了。", "name": "德鲁莎"}}, {"id": 213, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#4$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 214, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他们应当重视我们。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#4$1"}, {"id": 215, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#2$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 216, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "要是他们再重视我一点，可就要多给我派活了，训练新兵已经让我苦不堪言咯。", "name": "德鲁莎"}}, {"id": 217, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 218, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你是惩戒军教官……", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#4$1"}, {"id": 219, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 220, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "紧张是对的。刚刚你弯腰捡笔的时候，我确认了你背后的气瓶管少了一根，而我正好在远离观测厅的海岸捡到了一根类似的。", "name": "德鲁莎"}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#9$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 222, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "启动仪式当天，你应当早早完成了当时班次的任务，但你的装备却落在了非工作区域，解释一下你去了哪里？", "name": "德鲁莎"}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我——", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#4$1"}, {"id": 225, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 226, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她去帮我拿药了。", "name": "？？？"}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#9$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 228, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "纳乔？克莱门莎监事？", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#4$1"}, {"id": 229, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 231, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 232, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 234, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 235, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "长、长官，您也看见我这只手了，那天是我的假肢需要维护的日子。", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 236, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿奎拉关心每一位同胞，她总是主动帮我买防水涂料和生物阻隔剂，没有错过一次。她、她或许还留着那天的收据。", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 237, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 238, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "阿奎拉"}}, {"id": 240, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哎呀，看来是我误会了。不过——", "name": "德鲁莎"}}, {"id": 242, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抱歉，女士。我再三查阅记录，怎么都找不到审判庭的调查通知。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 244, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 245, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这位是克莱门莎监事吧？请不要见怪，这算不上调查。我本来也没想打扰各位伟大的打捞工作，奈何这身制服实在太扎眼了。", "name": "德鲁莎"}}, {"id": 246, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "惩戒军一般驻守在打捞中心外的岗哨，记录技术工的进出和行动。知晓一切的眼睛，想必不需要怀疑自己看到了什么。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 248, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "当然，这只是一次心血来潮的拜访，我还从来没有亲眼见过来自深海的同胞呢。", "name": "德鲁莎"}}, {"id": 250, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 251, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我想，我们的耳朵都是尖的。", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 252, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 253, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哈哈，当然。在弥利亚留姆，您一定是一位很得民心的执政官……", "name": "德鲁莎"}}, {"id": 254, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 255, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可惜，这里是伊比利亚。", "name": "德鲁莎"}}, {"id": 256, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 257, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "克莱门莎"}}, {"id": 258, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2267_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 259, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "先告辞了。", "name": "德鲁莎"}}, {"id": 260, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 261, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 262, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "-200,0", "duration": 1.0, "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0}}, {"id": 263, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 264, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 266, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}, {"id": 267, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿奎拉。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 269, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 270, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "克莱门莎监事，那个惩戒军所指控的一切，我毫不知情。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}, {"id": 271, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 272, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不用向我解释，阿奎拉。那位惩戒军有一点说得没错，这里是伊比利亚，如果我无法亲自核实她的判断，那我暂且不会多言。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1"}, {"id": 273, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 274, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}, {"id": 275, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 276, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "来到打捞中心的两天里，我跟技术工们聊了聊，他们中的大部分人非常信任你。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 277, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 278, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我只是做了应该做的事，我会为他们解决身为岛民不得不面对的问题。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}, {"id": 279, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 280, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "以什么方式？", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 281, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 282, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "任何方式。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}, {"id": 283, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 284, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我以为你会直接告诉我，你加入了一个互助会。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 285, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 286, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "有人告诉你了……但帮助同胞并不违反审判庭的戒律。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}, {"id": 287, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 288, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "当然，我只是想知道我是否能参加。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 289, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你也遇到了困难？", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#4$1"}, {"id": 291, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 292, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我希望解决你们的困难。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1"}, {"id": 293, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 294, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……导师说过，我们是面向所有阿戈尔人的互助会，它会向每一位疑惑、困苦、向往和平的阿戈尔人敞开大门。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#4$1"}, {"id": 295, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但我认为，克莱门莎监事和我们——岛民们，除了样貌之外并没有共通点，恐怕不会受到欢迎。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#4$1"}, {"id": 296, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 297, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我明白了。", "name": "克莱门莎"}, "figure_art": "avg_4231_clemnt_1#10$1"}, {"id": 298, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 299, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_higheldshosfts"}}, {"id": 300, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "-200,0", "duration": 1.2, "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0}}, {"id": 301, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 302, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 303, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#8$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 304, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 305, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 306, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#8$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 307, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 308, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 309, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "想问就开口。", "name": "阿奎拉"}}, {"id": 310, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#8$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 311, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我……", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 312, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 313, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你怕你问出自己心里最坏的答案？那你刚刚就不该为我做伪证。", "name": "阿奎拉"}}, {"id": 314, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 315, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿奎拉，你也看到了，克莱门莎监事显然发现了什么，但她还是帮你说话了。", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 316, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只要港都中心城区打捞成功，我们的生活就会好起来，你——", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 317, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 318, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你以前就是这样，总以为只要自己做得够好，经文背得够勤快，就能消除偏见。", "name": "阿奎拉"}}, {"id": 319, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "被鲁菲纳奶奶的事牵连的时候你什么都不说，现在你明明不想让我再去互助会还是一句话都不说。", "name": "阿奎拉"}}, {"id": 320, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 321, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿奎拉……", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 322, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 323, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但是，刚刚你也确实在惩戒军和克莱门莎监事面前替我隐瞒，对你来说已经很不容易了。", "name": "阿奎拉"}}, {"id": 324, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "纳乔，无论你是否认同我的想法，作为朋友我只托付你一件事。", "name": "阿奎拉"}}, {"id": 325, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "万一之后几天我出了什么事，你可以去互助会所在的教堂找我们的导师，他会帮我。", "name": "阿奎拉"}}, {"id": 326, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 327, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在此之前做你最擅长的事，什么都不要问也不要说。", "name": "阿奎拉"}}, {"id": 328, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 329, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我从不过问你做的事，阿奎拉，我只是不希望又有一个我熟悉的人陷入危险。", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 330, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "跟我的奶奶鲁菲纳一样。", "name": "纳乔"}}, {"id": 331, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 332, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "阿奎拉"}}, {"id": 333, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 334, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 335, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 336, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 337, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 338, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g14_ibchurch_2", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 339, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 340, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 341, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$nervous_intro", "key": "$nervous_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 342, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 343, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 344, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "谢谢……谢谢您……导师，我知道该怎么做了。", "name": "感激的岛民"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 345, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 346, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0, "bstart": 0.3, "bend": 0.6}}, {"id": 347, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 348, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 349, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "去吧，同胞。", "name": "“导师”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 350, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "放下仇恨，你会迎来内心真正的平静，如果它又起波澜，我仍会在这里倾听。", "name": "“导师”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 351, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 352, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n"}}, {"id": 353, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "duration": 1.0, "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0}}, {"id": 354, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 355, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0, "bstart": 0.3, "bend": 0.6}}, {"id": 356, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 357, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 358, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抱歉，这位同胞，迷惘的人太多，我想尽可能帮助他们，但我能力有限。", "name": "“导师”"}}, {"id": 359, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 360, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "“同胞”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 361, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 362, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不过现在，你应该也能理解和平为何可贵，纷争为何愚蠢。", "name": "“导师”"}}, {"id": 363, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "对你而言，在教堂里活动确实不太方便，我会撤掉这层伪装……我们的实验进行到哪里了？", "name": "“导师”"}}, {"id": 364, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 365, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "“同胞”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2272_1#1$1"}, {"id": 366, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 367, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g7_alsatelier", "screenadapt": "coverall", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 368, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.5}}, {"id": 369, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1388_1#1$1", "duration": 1.5, "bstart": 0.5, "bend": 0.8}}, {"id": 370, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 371, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 372, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 373, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 374, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唔，我的同胞，你无需对这些炼金仪器感到好奇，它们只是另一次实验的残影，我的回忆。", "name": "“导师”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 375, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "回归大群？不，你还需要陪伴我一段日子。", "name": "“导师”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 376, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哺育子代、呈递信息、同化异类……都已不是你的职责。实验很顺利，你已证明自己可以抑制本能。", "name": "“导师”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 377, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "下一步，我只需将实验缸里的鳞，换成——", "name": "“导师”"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 378, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 379, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 380, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$doorknockquite"}}, {"id": 381, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 382, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$dooropenquite"}}, {"id": 383, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 384, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 385, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抱歉打扰您，奥卢斯主教……", "name": "平和的教徒"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1"}, {"id": 386, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 387, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不打扰，我很高兴与你分享我的实验，它是我们共同畅想的未来的一环。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 388, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "另外，暂时忘了“主教”那个称呼吧。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 389, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我们是同行者，没有贵贱之分，只是在当下我比你理解、掌握的知识多一点点，所以暂且充当更重要的角色。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 390, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你从打捞中心来……我的布置没有奏效？", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 391, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 392, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不，如您所料，我们的同胞确实遇到了麻烦，但在我们插手之前，问题已经解决了。", "name": "平和的教徒"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1"}, {"id": 393, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一个年轻的阿戈尔人替她打了掩护，他对我们的计划一无所知。", "name": "平和的教徒"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_453_1#1$1"}, {"id": 394, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#7$1"}}, {"id": 395, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哦？", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#7$1"}, {"id": 396, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "同胞，请告诉我，那是一个怎样的人？", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#7$1"}, {"id": 397, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 398, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 399, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 400, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 401, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 402, "prop": "hidecgitem", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 403, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 404, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}